#~ shadowed_header
# fixedbugs, defect 2357, lane b25-pkgc, 2026-11-08.
#
# A fetched package shipping a `stdint.h` of its own, which reads the C
# library's and redefines `INT64_MAX` as 7. A package's folder is searched
# before the system's, by its own units and by every unit reaching its
# records, so its file stood in for the library's: `PK_TOP`, bound as
# `INT64_MAX`, printed 7 at exit 0 (measured on this Mac after defect 2351).
# Panel 237's tree route now asks every search the program's does not make,
# and its note names the package as who named the folder.
use <pk>/pk

function main()
    print(pk.top())
